msgid "From physical experiment to quantum circuits {#from-physical-experiment-to-quantum-circuits}"
msgstr "Dall'esperimento fisico ai circuiti quantistici {#from-physical-experiment-to-quantum-circuits}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"From the operations of these gates, we can see, for example, that the kets in the expressions for $P_{++}$:\n"
"$$\n"
"\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\left(|+\\rangle_L|-\\rangle_R-|-\\rangle_L|+\\rangle_R\\right)\n"
"$$\n"
"are likely to involve a Hadamard gate to get the superposition, and a CNOT gate to create the entanglement.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dalle operazioni di questi gate, possiamo vedere, ad esempio, che i ket nelle espressioni per $P_{++}$:\n"
"$$\n"
"\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\left(|+\\rangle_L|-\\rangle_R-|-\\rangle_L|+\\rangle_R\\right)\n"
"$$\n"
"probabilmente coinvolgono un gate di Hadamard per ottenere la sovrapposizione, e un gate CNOT per creare l'entanglement.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We will now use the H, X, and CNOT gates to turn $|0\\rangle_L|0\\rangle_R$ into $\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\left(|+\\rangle_L|-\\rangle_R-|-\\rangle_L|+\\rangle_R\\right)$:\n"
msgstr "Ora useremo i gate H, X e CNOT per trasformare $|0\\rangle_L|0\\rangle_R$ in $\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\left(|+\\rangle_L|-\\rangle_R-|-\\rangle_L|+\\rangle_R\\right)$:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\left(|0\\rangle_L|1\\rangle_R-|1\\rangle_L|0\\rangle_R\\right)\n"
"$$\n"
"$$\n"
"\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}CNOT_{LR}\\left(|0\\rangle_L|1\\rangle_R-|1\\rangle_L|1\\rangle_R\\right)\n"
"$$\n"
"Here $CNOT_{LR}$ means a CNOT gate using L as the control and R as the target. We can now factor out the R part of the state:\n"
"$$\n"
"\\text{CNOT}_{LR}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\left(|0\\rangle_L-|1\\rangle_L\\right)|1\\rangle_R\n"
"$$\n"
"$$\n"
"\\text{CNOT}_{LR} H_L|1\\rangle_L|1\\rangle_R\n"
"$$\n"
"$$\n"
"\\text{CNOT}_{LR} H_L X_L X_R|0\\rangle_L|0\\rangle_R\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\left(|0\\rangle_L|1\\rangle_R-|1\\rangle_L|0\\rangle_R\\right)\n"
"$$\n"
"$$\n"
"\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}CNOT_{LR}\\left(|0\\rangle_L|1\\rangle_R-|1\\rangle_L|1\\rangle_R\\right)\n"
"$$\n"
"Qui $CNOT_{LR}$ indica un gate CNOT che usa L come controllo e R come bersaglio. Possiamo ora fattorizzare la parte R dello stato:\n"
"$$\n"
"\\text{CNOT}_{LR}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\left(|0\\rangle_L-|1\\rangle_L\\right)|1\\rangle_R\n"
"$$\n"
"$$\n"
"\\text{CNOT}_{LR} H_L|1\\rangle_L|1\\rangle_R\n"
"$$\n"
"$$\n"
"\\text{CNOT}_{LR} H_L X_L X_R|0\\rangle_L|0\\rangle_R\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Now we have written the ket entirely as quantum gates operating on the default starting state of the qubits.\n"
msgstr "Abbiamo ora scritto il ket interamente come gate quantistici che agiscono sullo stato iniziale predefinito dei qubit.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Now we can use the $R_y(\\theta)$ acting on $\\vphantom{p}_L\\langle 0|_R\\langle 1|$ to obtain the bra in the expression for $P_{++}$.\n"
msgstr "Ora possiamo usare $R_y(\\theta)$ applicato a $\\vphantom{p}_L\\langle 0|_R\\langle 1|$ per ottenere il bra nell'espressione per $P_{++}$.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\vphantom{p}_L\\langle0|_R\\left(\\cos(\\theta/2)\\langle0|+\\sin(\\theta/2)\\langle1|\\right)\n"
"$$\n"
"$$\n"
"\\vphantom{p}_L\\langle0|_R\\left(|0\\rangle \\cos(\\theta/2)+|1\\rangle \\sin(\\theta/2)\\right)^{\\dagger}\n"
"$$\n"
"$$\n"
"\\vphantom{p}_L\\langle0|\\left(R_{y,R}(\\theta)|0\\rangle_R\\right)^{\\dagger}\n"
"$$\n"
"$$\n"
"\\vphantom{p}_L\\langle0|_R\\langle0|R_{y,R}(-\\theta)\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\vphantom{p}_L\\langle0|_R\\left(\\cos(\\theta/2)\\langle0|+\\sin(\\theta/2)\\langle1|\\right)\n"
"$$\n"
"$$\n"
"\\vphantom{p}_L\\langle0|_R\\left(|0\\rangle \\cos(\\theta/2)+|1\\rangle \\sin(\\theta/2)\\right)^{\\dagger}\n"
"$$\n"
"$$\n"
"\\vphantom{p}_L\\langle0|\\left(R_{y,R}(\\theta)|0\\rangle_R\\right)^{\\dagger}\n"
"$$\n"
"$$\n"
"\\vphantom{p}_L\\langle0|_R\\langle0|R_{y,R}(-\\theta)\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Combining these results, we can write the probability $P_{++}$ as\n"
msgstr "Combinando questi risultati, possiamo scrivere la probabilità $P_{++}$ come\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"p_{++}=\\left|\\vphantom{p}_L\\langle0|_R\\langle0|R_{y,R}(-\\theta)\\text{CNOT}_{LR} H_L X_L X_R|0\\rangle_L|0\\rangle_R\\right|^2\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"p_{++}=\\left|\\vphantom{p}_L\\langle0|_R\\langle0|R_{y,R}(-\\theta)\\text{CNOT}_{LR} H_L X_L X_R|0\\rangle_L|0\\rangle_R\\right|^2\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
