msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/modules/quantum-mechanics/bells-inequality-with-qiskit/extracted-outputs/6deb8aed-c959-4279-b338-7bdbb03ccdb2-0.avif)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Let us make a list of the possible outcomes and add up all the counts of each state from each of the three circuits to obtain overall probabilities.\n"
